msgstr "Rozsah buniek, z ktorého sa určí maximum."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range of cells from which the minimum will be determined."
msgstr "Rozsah buniek, z ktorého sa určí minimum."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The range of cells from which the number of unique values will be counted."
msgstr "Rozsah buniek, v ktorom sa spočíta počet jedinečných hodnôt."

